1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,610
You are a night museum guard.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:06,724
Nothing ever happens here.

3
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:16,628
Sixty-six million years dead. Mostly.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,960
THE DUCHESS: Lower that light, dear.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,960
YOU: Paintings don’t talk!

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
THE DUCHESS: And guards don’t nap. Yet here we are.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,460
THE MUMMY: Is it morning?

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,460
YOU: No...?

9
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,500
THE MUMMY: Five more centuries.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,100
YOU: H-hello?

11
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,610
EVERYONE: SURPRISE!

12
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:48,610
Nobody remembered your birthday.

13
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:51,180
Except the museum.

14
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:55,833
Nothing ever happens here.

